# Datasets downloaded for model training; record their source in docs/06-soup.md.
# Anchored to the repository root and named so it cannot collide with a source
# folder: git sets core.ignorecase=true on Windows, so a bare `data/` also
# matched `src/ElderSafe.Api/Data/` and silently kept it out of the repository.
/datasets/
*.csv.zip
# Commit trained model files only when a release needs them, with their metrics:
# !models/*.onnx

